                    </p>
                    <ul class="list-disc ml-4 mb-2 text-[11px] text-gray-600 space-y-1">
                        <li>Fixed overlay: <code>fixed inset-0 bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-sm z-50</code></li>
                        <li>Gradient header: <code>@@bgClass</code> from
